Last updated: March 21, 2026
1. Introduction
JDConclude is a Chrome extension that helps job seekers summarize English job descriptions from LinkedIn and Indeed into Chinese, generate personalized cover letters, and manage job search progress. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle your data.
2. Information We Collect
2.1 Information You Provide
Personal profile: Name, email, job preferences (stored locally in your browser)
Saved jobs: Job titles, companies, application status, notes
Generated content: Cover letters and summaries created by you
2.2 Information We Access
Job page content: When you actively click the JDConclude icon on LinkedIn/Indeed, we temporarily read the job description text visible on that page
3. How We Use Your Information
Table
Data	Purpose	Storage
Personal profile	Generate personalized cover letters	Local browser only (Chrome storage)
Saved jobs	Track your job application progress	Local browser only
Job descriptions	Create Chinese summaries and cover letters	Not stored — processed in real-time and discarded
Generated cover letters	For your copy/paste use	Local browser only
4. Data Processing & Third-Party Services
4.1 AI Processing (if applicable)
If JDConclude uses AI for summarization/cover letter generation:
Job descriptions and your profile data are sent to AI service providers (e.g., OpenAI, Anthropic, or similar)
We do not use your data to train AI models
Data is transmitted securely via HTTPS
Processing is done in real-time; inputs are not retained by AI providers per their data retention policies
4.2 No Sale of Data
We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties.
5. Data Storage & Security
All personal data is stored locally in your Chrome browser using Chrome Storage API
We do not operate external servers to store your data
Data is tied to your browser profile; uninstalling the extension removes all stored data
We recommend enabling Chrome sync if you wish to back up your data across devices
6. Permissions Explained
Table
Permission	Why We Need It
storage	Save your profile, settings, and saved jobs locally
activeTab	Temporarily access the current tab when you click our icon
scripting	Extract job description text from the page you activated
host permissions	Only for linkedin.com and indeed.com job pages
clipboardWrite (optional)	Copy generated cover letters to your clipboard
7. Your Rights
You can:
View all stored data in the extension's settings page
Delete all data by uninstalling the extension or using the "Clear All Data" button
Export your saved jobs (if feature is provided)
8. Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy. Changes will be posted here with an updated date.
